## Troubleshooting and Deployment

### Challenge

Agent testing was initially blocked by environment capacity and configuration issues.

**Error**

```text
EnforcementUsageCredits
This environment is out of credits.
```

### Investigation

Activities completed:

- Reviewed agent configuration
- Verified custom skills
- Investigated Dataverse permissions
- Tested alternative environments
- Researched billing and licensing requirements
- Reviewed Microsoft documentation

### Resolution

Implemented the following solution:

- Created a Sandbox environment
- Configured Azure Pay-As-You-Go billing
- Added the Copilot meter
- Linked environments to the billing plan
- Created a solution package
- Migrated the agent from the Default environment to the Sandbox environment

### Outcome

✅ Agent successfully deployed

✅ Preview functionality restored

✅ Website deployment enabled

✅ Chatbot successfully embedded on a live landing page

✅ End-to-end testing completed

